    "body": "How about we make it match my attempt at emulating? That is, we'd have three invites each repeating every 6 weeks. We could also fixate the time zone for each individually, e.g., aligning the meeting \"for\" Japan with the time zone there. The only downside would be having to duplicate the invite list. (I would be happy to help manage the invite list and add people as needed.)",
